# Go stdlib CVEs in /usr/bin/pebble (Go 1.26.7), inherited via the
# rouhim/steamcmd:latest base image (ubuntu:devel ships pebble since
# ~Sept 2026). Pebble is unused, is not owned by any deb package, and can
# therefore not be fixed via apt upgrade. Fixed upstream in Go 1.26.9 /
# 1.27.2 — drop these once the base image ships a fixed Go toolchain.
# Added 2026-10-14.
CVE-2026-78667
CVE-2026-78669
